{"3236930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roster:Alice's White Mouse", "steam_appid": 3236930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.mp4?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an age where humanity has gone extinct, you will play a “being” with no memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have hands to wield weapons, an intelligent brain to gather information and uncover monsters’ weak spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the laboratory infested with monsters and try to understand what you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned labs, a wounded planet, mutated creatures, invaders of every kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, a “lab rat” born into this world—what do you want?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/8a26d853fc98f5409de1d6bc4eb93f30.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/8a26d853fc98f5409de1d6bc4eb93f30.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To collect data, identify enemy vulnerabilities, aim your weapon at the precise point, block, counter-attack, dodge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight them up close or spend what little energy you have to strike from afar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on: fight, slaughter, tally your failures, and restart again and again, until the fragments you’ve gathered piece together the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=900 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.mp4?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic game operations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse controls weapon-attack direction (making it easier to hit weak spots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-click the movement key to expend energy on a dash (dodge)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take medicine to restore health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch backpack weight—or drop it temporarily to boost agility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, weigh the risks of attack/defense potions that leave lingering “after-effects”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether to spend energy on leveling up or on firearm rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/31a5bb5b8590a56841002413e3862277.mp4?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an age where humanity has gone extinct, you will play a “being” with no memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have hands to wield weapons, an intelligent brain to gather information and uncover monsters’ weak spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the laboratory infested with monsters and try to understand what you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned labs, a wounded planet, mutated creatures, invaders of every kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, a “lab rat” born into this world—what do you want?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/8a26d853fc98f5409de1d6bc4eb93f30.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/8a26d853fc98f5409de1d6bc4eb93f30.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To collect data, identify enemy vulnerabilities, aim your weapon at the precise point, block, counter-attack, dodge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight them up close or spend what little energy you have to strike from afar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on: fight, slaughter, tally your failures, and restart again and again, until the fragments you’ve gathered piece together the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.poster.avif?t=1778006224\" width=900 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.webm?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/extras/0cf6354b02785b4fae6a00624c0da158.mp4?t=1778006224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic game operations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse controls weapon-attack direction (making it easier to hit weak spots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-click the movement key to expend energy on a dash (dodge)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take medicine to restore health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch backpack weight—or drop it temporarily to boost agility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, weigh the risks of attack/defense potions that leave lingering “after-effects”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether to spend energy on leveling up or on firearm rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "This is a first-person dark sci-fi game. When the world is no longer habitable, when resources run low, monsters will begin to slaughter each other. And you, the lab mouse just awakened—what path will you take?", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236930/header.jpg?t=1